EA21344034E85C50C721A8C79D81ADC01BC72773242AA","bytes":1756186,"pages":5,"questionPage":1,"printedAnswer":"⑤","sourceSolutionSummary":"For x<−3, using √(−u)=i√u, the product equals −√(x²−x−12); x=−3 also satisfies. The other intervals do not satisfy the source equation; the explicit x≠4 condition excludes x=4."},"officialAnswerKeyPdf":{"absolutePath":"D:\\기출\\(1)1중간\\(1)1중간\\수학(상)\\2024_효천고1_1중간_정답.pdf","sha256":"08650DDAF4EB8427A98743A1BE56413C6826846E764D3A3A959523BE05C781E3","bytes":719091,"pages":2,"questionPage":1,"printedQ7Answer":"⑤"},"companionHwp":{"status":"NOT_FOUND_BY_SOURCE_FILENAME_SEARCH","note":"No matching 2024_효천고1_1중간 HWP was found; scanned exam PDF, solution PDF, and answer-key PDF are present and were visually reviewed."},"sourceQuestion":{"printedStem":"등식 √(x−4)√(x+3)=−√(x²−x−12)를 만족시키는 x≠4인 모든 실수에 대하여 |x−6|+|x+3|=ax+b가 성립한다. 두 실수 a,b에 대하여 b−a의 값은? [3.6점]","printedChoices":["① 1","② 2","③ 3","④ 4","⑤ 5"],"printedAnswer":"⑤","independentMath":"For x<−3, both radicands are negative and (i√(4−x))(i√(−x−3))=−√((x−4)(x+3))=−√(x²−x−12). At x=−3 the equality also holds. For −3<x<4 the sides have opposite imaginary signs; for x>4 they have opposite real signs; x=4 is excluded. Thus solutions are x≤−3. Then |x−6|+|x+3|=−2x+3, a=−2, b=3, b−a=5."},"comparison":{"before":{"jsSha256":"2FF0D1DD97F217865663BC9551BE09564589DB6018ECA269F99C8D3E2ADAAB2D","content":"등식 $\\sqrt{4-x}\\sqrt{-x-3}=\\sqrt{x^{2}-x-12}$를 만족시키는 모든 실수 $x$에 대하여 $|x-6|+|x+3|=ax+b$가 성립한다. 두 실수 $a, b$에 대하여 $b-a$의 값은?","contentSha256":"ED0FCFE0176DFE70DEC44624DC1D3DE94CC83778E7C0B2F99A01986CA8B2A7B9","choices":["① $1$","② $2$","③ $3$","④ $4$","⑤ $5$"],"choicesSha256":"87A35902192B2AC3B25426497A6D1A734782C9179EBE9681C48610ECA527F0D8","answer":"⑤","answerSha256":"F3EAA647E8A4604EA6BC01C74DFB365ACE6754FB867E170B933CC24EB6A81E7B","solutionHash":"F61DC827970E9744CA7E740F5EA56D6543DD180BA64CC0E1A12F572F36B9F2EE"},"after":{"jsSha256":"1F9144DF83E9C3F631B95D4C1D8321088E4E8A952DD2EEFD84EF74C3A6141F10","content":"등식 $\\sqrt{x-4}\\sqrt{x+3}=-\\sqrt{x^{2}-x-12}$를 만족시키는 $x\\ne4$인 모든 실수에 대하여 $|x-6|+|x+3|=ax+b$가 성립한다. 두 실수 $a, b$에 대하여 $b-a$의 값은? [3.6점]","contentSha256":"E4457D4BF7E0F12464E7A0413C99AA5720FFA7E618F4CA5786DA8CBBD1DB05AB","choices":["① $1$","② $2$","③ $3$","④ $4$","⑤ $5$"],"choicesSha256":"87A35902192B2AC3B25426497A6D1A734782C9179EBE9681C48610ECA527F0D8","answer":"⑤","answerSha256":"F3EAA647E8A4604EA6BC01C74DFB365ACE6754FB867E170B933CC24EB6A81E7B","solution":"[키포인트]\n제곱근의 성질과 절댓값 기호의 성질을 이용하여 식을 단순화한다.\n\n조건 정리\n$x<-3$에서는 $\\sqrt{-u}=i\\sqrt{u}$를 이용하여 $\\sqrt{x-4}\\sqrt{x+3}=-\\sqrt{x^2-x-12}$이다. $-3<x<4$에서는 두 변의 허수부 부호가 서로 반대이고, $x>4$에서는 실수부 부호가 서로 반대이며, $x=4$는 조건에서 제외된다. 또한 $x=-3$에서도 등식이 성립한다. 따라서 해는 $x\\le-3$이다.\n\n풀이 과정\n1단계: $x \\le -3$일 때, $x-6$은 음수이므로 $|x-6| = -x+6$이다.\n2단계: $x \\le -3$일 때, $x+3$은 $0$ 이하이므로 $|x+3| = -x-3$이다.\n3단계: $|x-6|+|x+3| = (-x+6) + (-x-3) = -2x+3$이다.\n4단계: $a = -2, b = 3$이므로 $b-a = 3 - (-2) = 5$이다.\n\n결론\n따라서 정답은 ⑤이다.","solutionSha256":"4DCCE993286E22AA95AC1E66BD770EF3D2311493EAD2940D704FC3431A32A889"},"modifiedFields":["content","solution domain-condition explanation"],"unchangedFields":["choices","answer","image (none declared)","all other question objects"]},"repair":{"verdict":"SOURCE_EXACT_RESTORE","confidence":"HIGH","exactContentAfter":"등식 $\\sqrt{x-4}\\sqrt{x+3}=-\\sqrt{x^{2}-x-12}$를 만족시키는 $x\\ne4$인 모든 실수에 대하여 $|x-6|+|x+3|=ax+b$가 성립한다. 두 실수 $a, b$에 대하여 $b-a$의 값은? [3.6점]","solutionDomainCorrection":"Replaced the old 4−x/−x−3 real-domain argument with a principal-complex-root case check for the printed x−4/x+3 equation, retained x≠4, and confirmed x≤−3 including x=−3.","semanticEffect":"Removes extra complex-domain solution values introduced by the transformed-root statement and restores the explicit x≠4 exclusion."},"machineChecks":{"nodeCheck":"PASS","schemaScan":{"status":"PASS","method":"read-only scanJsBank selected-source","files":1,"questions":23,"loadErrors":0,"nonSequentialIdFiles":0,"duplicateIdFiles":0,"missi